## 🐳 Docker Deployment

The project includes an optimized multi-stage `Dockerfile` leveraging UV layer caching and non-root runtime:

```bash
# Build the Docker image
docker build -t {{ project_name }}:v1 .

# Run the container
docker run --rm -p 8000:8000 --name {{ project_name }}-app {{ project_name }}:v1
```

